  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Dreaming of a renowned Law School in the USA? Washington University School of Law is a great choice. Often called WashULaw, the School is a part of Washington University in St. Louis, one of the most respected private universities in the United States. The school offers JD, LLM, and MLS programmes, attracting students from over 30 countries.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>Your student life at WashULaw will be inclusive and supportive. Beyond academics, there are numerous student organisations, which will keep you engaged. Plus, you can enjoy access to cultural events, green spaces, and fitness facilities.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>You get convenient student accommodation options at WashULaw, with options both on and near the campus. The surrounding neighbourhoods offer a mix of quiet residential streets and lively areas with cafes, restaurants, and parks.</p><p><i>If you’re looking for budget-friendly accommodation options outside the campus, feel free to </i><a href=\"https://edvoy.com/app/\"><i>download our app</i></a><i> and check out the Stays feature!</i></p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Library</strong><br>The university library offers quiet study areas, collaborative spaces, and extensive print and digital resources.</p><p><strong>Sports</strong><br>On campus, you’ll have access to fitness centres, recreational sports, and wellness facilities to keep yourself active.</p><p><strong>Cafeteria</strong><br>The cafeteria provides a variety of meal options, along with spaces to relax.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
